{"id":"73437ec81adf4378a5e4239ad7dffefa6bfd6a26","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"73437ec81adf4378a5e4239ad7dffefa6bfd6a26","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/thick-forks-wave.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@","+---","+\"@pnpm/bins.linker\": patch","+\"pnpm\": patch","+\"pacquet\": patch","+---","+","+Bin linking leaves workspace and linked dependency files outside node_modules unchanged. Already executable bin files no longer receive redundant permission changes."],"additions":7,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/tests/suite/hoisted_node_linker/scripts.rs","lines":["@@ -327,7 +327,7 @@ fn linking_bins_of_local_projects() {"," }"," "," /// The hoisted linker turns `preferSymlinkedExecutables` on by","-/// default, so on Unix `.bin` entries are symlinks to the bin file","+/// default, so on Unix `.bin` entries are symlinks to executable bin files"," /// instead of shell shims — pnpm's `nodeLinker: hoisted` behavior. An"," /// explicit `preferSymlinkedExecutables: false` restores the shims."," #[test]","@@ -348,8 +348,14 @@ fn hoisted_linker_symlinks_bins_by_default() {","         let mut provider_manifest = read_manifest(&provider);","         provider_manifest[\"bin\"] = serde_json::json!({ \"project-2\": \"index.js\" });","         write_manifest_value(&provider, &provider_manifest);","+        #[cfg(windows)]","         fs::write(provider.join(\"index.js\"), \"#!/usr/bin/env node\\nconsole.log('hello')\\n\")","             .expect(\"write project bin\");","+        #[cfg(unix)]","+        crate::_utils::write_executable(","+            &provider.join(\"index.js\"),","+            \"#!/usr/bin/env node\\nconsole.log('hello')\\n\",","+        );"," ","         fixture.run([\"install\"]);"," "],"additions":7,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/tests/suite/workspace_install.rs","lines":["@@ -856,7 +856,7 @@ fn install_does_not_scaffold_a_root_manifest_in_a_workspace() {"," }"," "," /// With `preferSymlinkedExecuta